  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://assets.lieonstudios.dev/common/badges/label/lieon-studios-creation.svg\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.lieonlion.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/pnk2u/More-Stick-Variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <sup><img width=\"5\" height=\"8\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/icon/separator_v.svg\"> pnku:</sup> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.pnku.de%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/shared/pres/icon/pnku_de_logo.svg\" alt=\"pnku.de\"></a> <img src=\"https://assets.lieonstudios.dev/common/dividers/horizontal/pnku_top.svg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>更多木棍变体</h1>\n<p>木板已经存在于所有木材类型中，我们可以使用它们来制作“更多 X 变体”物品。但如果制作配方仅包含木棍呢？这就是“更多木棍变体”模组所要解决的问题，所有主要需要木棍的制作配方的变体模组都将基于此模组。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">现有的 'MStV+' 模组</span></strong>: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-armor-stand-variants/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>更多盔甲架变体</em></a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-fishing-rod-variants/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>更多（钓鱼竿）变体</em></a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-torch-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>更多火把变体</em></a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nemos-more-ladder-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nemo's More Ladder Variants</a>, <em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-tool-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多工具变体</a></em>, <em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-frame-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多（物品/画）框变体</a></em>, <em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-weapon-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多武器变体</a></em>, <em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-rail-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多铁轨变体</a></em><br>\n注意：虽然“Nemo's Campfires”不是一个“MStV+”模组，但它完全兼容“更多木棍变体”，基本上就是我如果制作一个《更多营火变体》模组时应有的样子。</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">即将推出的 'MStV+' 模组</span></strong>: 《更多红石组件变体》</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>其他将木棍作为配方的变体模组怎么办？</h2>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>其制作配方中包含木棍的变体模组（例如目前唯一的《更多磨石变体》）均与“更多木棍变体”兼容。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>原版使用木棍作为配方的食谱怎么办？</h2>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>此模组还更新了所有使用木棍的配方，以便所有变体木棍都可以使用，并且栅栏、栅栏门和告示牌本质上已经按木材类型分离，现在它们将仅使用相应的木棍变体，请参阅下面的制作配方动图：</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/refs/heads/main/ModProjects/More-Stick-Variants/pres/fence_recipe_anim.gif\" alt=\"\"> | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/refs/heads/main/ModProjects/More-Stick-Variants/pres/fence_gate_recipe_anim.gif\" alt=\"\"> | <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/refs/heads/main/ModProjects/More-Stick-Variants/pres/sign_recipe_anim.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>此外，原版木棍物品现在被视为<strong><em>橡木棍</em></strong>，而“<em>竹棍</em>”的位置则由竹子物品本身取代。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/refs/heads/main/ModProjects/More-Stick-Variants/pres/cf_desc_banner.webp\" alt=\"\"> 使用“<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-frame-variants/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多画框变体</a>”展示所有新添加的木棍。</p>\n<h2>为 Minecraft 添加了 11 种新的<em>木棍</em>。</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/hunnycakehorse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/refs/heads/main/ModProjects/More-Stick-Variants/pres/pale_oak_stick.png\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp; 苍白橡木棍及大多数苍白橡木 MStV+ 纹理由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/hunnycakehorse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">hunnycakehorse</a> 制作</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://assets.lieonstudios.dev/common/dividers/horizontal/pnku_bottom.svg\" alt=\"\"></p>",
